WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.156
Lesson four. My family!

2
00:00:04.086 --> 00:00:11.253
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.229 --> 00:00:13.753
Coco, this is my family!

4
00:00:13.803 --> 00:00:15.875
Ooh! Let's meet them!

5
00:00:17.197 --> 00:00:18.188
This is my mummy.

6
00:00:18.238 --> 00:00:21.306
Mummy! Say it with me. Mummy!

7
00:00:25.748 --> 00:00:26.791
This is my daddy.

8
00:00:26.841 --> 00:00:30.000
Daddy! Say it with me. Daddy!

9
00:00:34.419 --> 00:00:35.434
This is my baby.

10
00:00:35.484 --> 00:00:38.621
Baby! Say it with me. Baby!

11
00:00:43.068 --> 00:00:44.053
This is my brother.

12
00:00:44.103 --> 00:00:47.102
Brother! Say it with me. Brother!

13
00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:52.610
This is my sister.

14
00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:55.874
Sister! Say it with me. Sister!

15
00:01:00.303 --> 00:01:01.460
This is my grandma!

16
00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:08.583
Grandma! Say it with me. Grandma!

17
00:01:08.633 --> 00:01:10.178
Hello, grandma!

18
00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:16.022
Who's this?

19
00:01:16.072 --> 00:01:17.381
It's mummy!

20
00:01:18.276 --> 00:01:22.570
Who's this?

21
00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:23.864
It's baby!

22
00:01:24.909 --> 00:01:31.259
This is D. D is for dog. Dog! D is for duck. Duck!

23
00:01:35.206 --> 00:01:41.383
Family hug! Hug your mummy! Hug your daddy!

24
00:01:41.433 --> 00:01:42.853
I love my family!

25
00:01:43.638 --> 00:01:50.982
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

26
00:01:51.032 --> 00:01:52.750
Bye-bye, friends!

